# Backlog #27 (2026-07-29): the _paste_*.txt corpus IS committed, deliberately.
# Rationale (Damien's call, 2026-07-29): OneDrive backs the files up but does NOT make
# them reachable when he is away from the laptop (Desktop Commander needs the machine),
# so keeping them out of git limited mobile work AND left the corpus single-homed.
# Checked before committing: the pastes contain no account numbers, balances, emails or
# payment data - and the PUBLIC board already publishes every bet id, wager and payout,
# so committing them exposes essentially nothing new. Committing also lets CI run the
# full 50-file regression instead of only the synthetic fixtures.

